        "suffix": ", is an efficient method",
        "valueSource": "extracted"
      },
      "description": {
        "value": "CLIP learns a multi-modal embedding space by jointly training an image encoder and text encoder to maximize the cosine similarity of the image and text embeddings of the N real pairs in the batch while minimizing the cosine similarity of the embeddings of the N^2 - N incorrect pairings.",
